{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A visual novel filled with strange, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>alluring characters and a lurking, dark danger.</strong><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/125825b017b3b22dcba76d6a47e461e7.avif?t=1761235353\" width=688 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious forest with no idea how you got there - just a surreal invitation to a masquerade ball and a bad feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating manipulative meetings and potential romance, you\u2019ll find yourself in a realm where fears take form and emotions have teeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice deepens a bond -\u00a0or drives the world toward its undoing. <br><br>In this story you can choose to love, to trust, to save the world - or watch it all burn! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/7225ab26ba7e6b709ec51386e271c6f0.avif?t=1761235353\" width=648 height=178 /></span><br>Branching choice-driven narrative with 12 different endings <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/e7302540defb4561be005ae576d32f63.avif?t=1761235353\" width=688 height=173 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/72647bf873f62fc9dacc412c2001565b.avif?t=1761235353\" width=648 height=178 /></span><br>Personalisation via name and a non-descript, non-gendered player character <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/39da653fd16df3791ccdbd4301cffe71.avif?t=1761235353\" width=688 height=173 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/d73840e2de324a03ff2bdbf73ec71b4f.avif?t=1761235353\" width=648 height=178 /></span><br>Rich, hand-drawn character illustrations, backgrounds and UI <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/0acd464a6913a1738b6c7085542411dc.avif?t=1761235353\" width=688 height=173 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926910/extras/c2afa6179173df49b8891632a55cc7b6.avif?t=1761235353\" width=648 height=178 /></span><br>5 potential, non-mandatory romances</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You met Ende","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/31c73b122ba003741d7d0608e2a457b9496f65b7.jpg"},{"name":"You met Lesan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/6583343a81ff1865868ded059b8e13efdf0c67bc.jpg"},{"name":"You met Ness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/183770fc1205b5879b4856c47cb2858772c49d1e.jpg"},{"name":"You met Skirun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/96710d25f428f5356d244115e3714ceef42ebc1c.jpg"},{"name":"You met Noht","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/1912c4a8aeeeda8e8433f92e20994b23f1483b43.jpg"},{"name":"You met the Fox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/e06c9aaa6bdacdc6a206449e0530f343316c8ac4.jpg"},{"name":"Sided with Noht","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2926910/6c99c6b3115f912685c24c1ea742f6519579bbab.jpg"},{"name":"Sided with Ende","